Save:

Ctrl + O → Enter → Ctrl + X

The PDF specifically uses 9093 for Java programs running on the host, while kafka:9092 is for clients inside Docker.

⭐ Important

For this Week-5 experiment:

Docker internal → kafka:9092
Your Java program → 127.0.0.1:9093

So do not change the Java code to 9092.

